  "abstract": {
    "value": "Diversity-oriented synthesis strategy for the eficient assembly of indole-fused polycyclic scafolds via rhodiumcatalyzed NH-indole-directed C−H coupling with propargylic alcohol derivatives in a regioselective manner was developed. Five 2- phenyl-1H-indole-embedded core skeletons were synthesized. In particular, three diferent indole-fused exo-olefin-containing polycycles were realized, which may be manipulated for further chemistry.",
